<title>HONG KONG: Pico Far East yearly profit doubled.</title>
<headline>Pico Far East yearly profit doubled.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended October 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   22.6     vs 16.5</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.0	vs 5.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  4.74     vs 0.90</p>
<p>    Net			    80.02    vs 37.00</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,020.83 vs 474.90</p>
<p>    Company name		 Pico Far East Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 19-25</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   May 12</p>
<p>NOTE - Pico Far East is an exhibition stands designer and maker. Net is after an exceptional gain of HK$4.74 million on sale of subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nine H.K. cents (including interim dividend of three cents) vs six cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
